# 📚 Data Structures Practice in C

Welcome to my **DS-Practice** repository! 🚀

This repository contains my Data Structures practice programs, coding exercises, and solutions implemented in **C programming language**. The goal is to improve my problem-solving skills and strengthen my understanding of Data Structures.

## 🎯 Objectives

- Learn and implement Data Structures using C.
- Practice coding problems regularly.
- Understand algorithms and their time complexity.
- Improve logical thinking and problem-solving skills.
- Maintain a record of my learning journey.

